,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-06-17T12:04:03Z","updated_at":"2025-07-01T23:05:34Z","closed_at":"2025-07-01T23:04:06Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproduced in:\n- v4.4.1.stable.fedora [49a5bc7b6] (latest stable build)\n- v4.5.dev5.official [64b09905c] (latest dev build)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable (49a5bc7b6) - Fedora Linux 42 (Workstation Edition) on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated Intel(R) HD Graphics 5500 (BDW GT2) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-5600U CPU @ 2.60GHz (4 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe `$Selector` syntax is sugar for **Node.get_node()** with a quality-of-life bonus in the script editor: it is aware of the actual node class and thus offers a complete list of members is the picklist. However, when assigned to a variable, it works only on the immediate statement, and not past the 2nd one. Let me demonstrate.\n\nAssume a simple scene with a single child node **Label**. I `$`-select the child and store it in a var.\n\n✅ On the next line in my script, I get a complete picklist of the **Label** members, **get_line_count()** is one of them.\n\n![complete-on-next-line.png](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/98c8de0c-6151-4423-b452-94a1fc11fb46)\n\n❌ On lines not immediately followed by the var assignment, I get a picklist for **Node** class only. E.g. the aforementioned **Label**'s method **get_line_count()** is not offered anymore.\n\n![complete-past-2nd-line.png](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eb203f60-e16a-4343-8fd6-e9e05ae60bea)\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Make a new, blank project.\n2. Create a 2D scene (Node2D).\n3. Add a child node, say Label.\n4. Attach a script to the root node Node2D.\n5. Try:\n```\nextends Node2D\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tvar lbl := $Label\n\t# Try code complete \"lbl.getlc\" on this line: get all Label members\n\tvar _foo := 42\n\t# ...and then try code complete \"lbl.getlc\" on this line: get Node members only\n```\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nAdded upon request: [complete-node-reference-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20778157/complete-node-reference-bug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107626/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107626/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}